msgstr "Paroles :"

#: package/contents/ui/config/ConfigServices.qml:67
msgid ""
"When Deezer has no synced lyrics, they are looked up on LRCLIB (lrclib.net), "
"a free database made by its users."
msgstr ""
"Quand Deezer n'a pas de paroles synchronisées, elles sont cherchées sur "
"LRCLIB (lrclib.net), une base libre faite par ses utilisateurs."

#: package/contents/ui/config/ConfigServices.qml:72
msgid "Extended sources (lrcmux)"
msgstr "Sources étendues (lrcmux)"

#: package/contents/ui/config/ConfigServices.qml:80
msgid ""
"When Deezer and LRCLIB have no synced lyrics, asks lrcmux, which gathers "
"them from YouTube Music, KuGou, Musixmatch and others. These are unofficial, "
"unlicensed sources: for personal use, and the service may stop at any time."
msgstr ""
"Quand Deezer et LRCLIB n'ont pas de paroles synchronisées, interroge lrcmux, "
"qui les rassemble depuis YouTube Music, KuGou, Musixmatch et d'autres. Ce "
"sont des sources non officielles et sans licence : pour un usage personnel, "
"et le service peut s'arrêter à tout moment."

#: package/contents/ui/config/ConfigServices.qml:85
msgid "Translation of lyrics Deezer does not translate"
msgstr "Traduction des paroles que Deezer ne traduit pas"

#: package/contents/ui/config/ConfigServices.qml:89
